# Release-archive hygiene: keep `git archive` (the extension package) lean.
# These dev-only paths are excluded from the exported tarball so a consumer
# installing the extension gets the extension — not this repo's own SpecKit
# scaffold, agent config, spec history, virtualenv, or CI.
/.specify       export-ignore
/.claude        export-ignore
/specs          export-ignore
/.venv          export-ignore
/.github        export-ignore
/HANDOFF.md     export-ignore
# This repo's own dogfood pin state (its entries reference the excluded /specs history).
/.spec-arch-pins.yml  export-ignore
